OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for killing dad on     
OL,4,Anight out celebrating son's engagment  
OL,6,FThe family of a father killed as he    
OL,7,Fcelebrated his son's engagement say    
OL,8,Fthey have been "robbed of years of     
OL,9,Flove, laughter, memories".             
OL,11,FMartin Slezak, 23, was found guilty of 
OL,12,Fmanslaughter after an altercation in a 
OL,13,Fkebab shop in Welshpool, Powys, in     
OL,14,FJune.                                  
OL,16,FPolice said Young John Mongan, 49, had 
OL,17,Ftravelled from his home in Walsall,    
OL,18,FWest Midlands, with his wife and       
OL,19,Fchildren for the celebrations when an  
OL,20,Fincident broke out between him and     
OL,21,FSlezak.                                
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
