OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for killing dad on     
OL,4,Anight out celebrating son's engagment  
OL,6,FSlezak, of Stanley Street, Welshpool,  
OL,7,Fwas jailed for 10 years after being    
OL,8,Fsentenced by Judge Geraint Walters at  
OL,9,FCaernarfon Crown Court.                
